# These files are checksummed byte-for-byte and the app rejects any mismatch, so
# line-ending translation must never touch them. Without this, a commit from a
# Windows checkout could publish CRLF while the digest was computed over LF.
docs/content.json          -text
docs/content-index.json    -text
docs/app-version.json      -text
docs/news.json             -text
app/src/main/assets/*.json -text
app/src/main/assets/content-version.txt -text

*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
